        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086240/extras/a6022cd8003a99a62decd622f14613c6.avif?t=1773738542\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1997 A.D. You're a throwaway bounty hunter for the local Sheriff's Department. You've amounted quite a debt buying useless crap hoping it would make you happy, it didn't. After a late shift of bagging scum off the streets, home was too far away and that gas station seafood from earlier has just wreaked havoc on your insides. Just in time you arrive at a Humane Fuels truck stop just off the interstate. While making yourself comfortable in one of the disgusting restroom stalls, you notice a photo of the Humane Fuels/Meats' baron with $5,000 bounty on his head. Considering who he is, accepting this job will make some very important people very angry with you. On the other hand, the money will keep the banks from shipping you to an off-world mining site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086240/extras/b0290f83b5218b02ba259266c6276856.avif?t=1773738542\" width=256 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Levels with unique settings for each including post-game stuff to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn sprites/textures (with a drawing tablet)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns, grenades, etc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music (multiple tracks on some levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of enemies to dispose of (some even being level specific).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An FOV Slider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leaning system for dealing with annoying enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reloading and scope-in system for getting long range enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086240/extras/81aff41352ac2d5bd67fece210acc7f4.avif?t=1773738542\" width=624 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE HUMANE FUELS/MEATS LOGO IS PROPERTY OF HUMANE FUELS/ MEATS ENTERPRISES, ANYONE WHO USES IT WITHOUT PERMISSION WILL BE TURNED INTO ECO-FRIENDLY ALTERNATIVE INGREDIENTS .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ultra-wide support at this time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086240/extras/a6022cd8003a99a62decd622f14613c6.avif?t=1773738542\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1997 A.D. You're a throwaway bounty hunter for the local Sheriff's Department. You've amounted quite a debt buying useless crap hoping it would make you happy, it didn't. After a late shift of bagging scum off the streets, home was too far away and that gas station seafood from earlier has just wreaked havoc on your insides. Just in time you arrive at a Humane Fuels truck stop just off the interstate. While making yourself comfortable in one of the disgusting restroom stalls, you notice a photo of the Humane Fuels/Meats' baron with $5,000 bounty on his head. Considering who he is, accepting this job will make some very important people very angry with you. On the other hand, the money will keep the banks from shipping you to an off-world mining site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086240/extras/b0290f83b5218b02ba259266c6276856.avif?t=1773738542\" width=256 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Levels with unique settings for each including post-game stuff to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn sprites/textures (with a drawing tablet)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns, grenades, etc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music (multiple tracks on some levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of enemies to dispose of (some even being level specific).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An FOV Slider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leaning system for dealing with annoying enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reloading and scope-in system for getting long range enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086240/extras/81aff41352ac2d5bd67fece210acc7f4.avif?t=1773738542\" width=624 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE HUMANE FUELS/MEATS LOGO IS PROPERTY OF HUMANE FUELS/ MEATS ENTERPRISES, ANYONE WHO USES IT WITHOUT PERMISSION WILL BE TURNED INTO ECO-FRIENDLY ALTERNATIVE INGREDIENTS .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ultra-wide support at this time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
